WEBVTT - AccessLearn Ethiopia English Captions
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Welcome to AccessLearn Ethiopia, the inclusive learning media platform.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
Our mission is ensuring that every learner across Ethiopia has equal access to quality education.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Whether you are Deaf, hard-of-hearing, blind, low-vision, or using a 2G mobile network, this player is built for you.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.000
Notice the custom accessible controls: you can adjust playback speed from 0.5x to 2x using the keyboard.

00:21.500 --> 00:27.000
Closed captions are available in both English and Amharic, with customizable font sizes and high-contrast color palettes.

00:27.500 --> 00:33.000
The Ethiopian Sign Language overlay window can be moved to any corner or resized to fit your visual preferences.

00:33.500 --> 00:39.000
Interactive transcripts below the player highlight active speech in real time and allow instant seeking by clicking any sentence.

00:39.500 --> 00:45.000
When preparing for travel or low-connectivity areas, download the complete 3G offline learning pack directly to your device.

00:45.500 --> 00:52.000
One lesson. Multiple ways to learn. No learner left behind.
